# Array Traversal

## Platform
GeeksforGeeks

## Difficulty
Basic

## Topic
Arrays

## Problem Link
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/array-traversal/1

## Approach
Traversed the array from the first element to the last using a `for` loop. Printed each element followed by a space to display all elements in their original order.

## Time Complexity
O(n)

## Space Complexity
O(1)

## Key Learning
- Learned how to traverse an array using a `for` loop.
- Understood the use of `arr.length` to iterate through all elements.
- Practiced accessing array elements using their indices.
- Learned the basics of displaying array contents.

